      "text": "Arrive at Bogotá’s international airport, where you’ll be met and transferred to your hotel.\n\nThe Spanish founded Bogotá in the 16th century on the site of earlier Indigenous settlements. The city’s name is associated with that of a Chibcha chief. Today the capital brings together historic neighbourhoods, museums, restaurants and cafés, and modern urban development.\n\nAfter your flight, check in at your hotel and take time to rest."
